From 5057d835708a8fc4940928987fadabdc464edbd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sun, 22 Feb 2026 21:12:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/a2xx: add VGT DMA wait on A22X before draw

Add CP_WAIT_REG_EQ to poll RBBM_STATUS for VGT_BUSY_NO_DMA bit (0x1000)
on Adreno 220/225 before each draw call.

The A20x has a known HW bug requiring DMA synchronization, and testing
shows A22X has similar timing issues. The previous OUT_WFI alone does
not wait for VGT DMA completion, which can cause intermittent faceted
rendering when vertex fetch starts before buffer addresses are fully
written.

Note: The A20x-style dummy draw with PRE_FETCH_CULL_ENABLE causes GPU
hangs on A22X, so we only use the register poll without the dummy draw.

Upstream-Status: Pending [hardware workaround]

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a2xx/fd2_draw.c | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a2xx/fd2_draw.c b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a2xx/fd2_draw.c
index f5d6c3f..4624b89 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a2xx/fd2_draw.c
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a2xx/fd2_draw.c
@@ -189,7 +189,17 @@ draw_impl(struct fd_context *ctx, const struct pipe_draw_info *info,
                 0);
       OUT_RING(ring, 0x00000006);
    } else {
-      OUT_WFI(ring);
+      /* A22X workaround: wait for VGT DMA to complete before draw.
+       * This fixes some intermittent faceted rendering where vertex fetch
+       * may start before DMA writes are complete.
+       * Note: A20x-style dummy draw causes GPU hang on A22X, so we only
+       * use the register poll here.
+       */
+      OUT_PKT3(ring, CP_WAIT_REG_EQ, 4);
+      OUT_RING(ring, 0x000005d0); /* RBBM_STATUS */
+      OUT_RING(ring, 0x00000000);
+      OUT_RING(ring, 0x00001000); /* bit 12: VGT_BUSY_NO_DMA */
+      OUT_RING(ring, 0x00000001);
 
       OUT_PKT3(ring, CP_SET_CONSTANT, 3);
       OUT_RING(ring, CP_REG(REG_A2XX_VGT_MAX_VTX_INDX));
-- 
